{"unit_id":"dadazhangn__dsh-prompt-snippets#card-zh","repo":"dadazhangn/dsh-prompt-snippets","commit":"0f9ee1307058696d6541fc057cdd40b4fc895bf8","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Prompt Snippets 是一款面向 DSH Web 的提示词片段库，通过输入框旁的面板和快捷搜索接入对话编辑器。你可以保存带 {{变量}} 的提示词，在插入前填写必填项、默认值或下拉选项；按名称、分类、标签和正文搜索，收藏置顶并查看版本历史。插件还提供片段编辑、撤销删除、JSON 导入导出，以及可选的 AI 改写预览。适合需要反复使用和管理提示词模板的 DSH 用户。片段默认保存在本地；AI 改写需要 DSH 已配置默认模型。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1947","client.js:3515","index.js:910-962"]}
{"unit_id":"dadazhangn__dsh-prompt-snippets#card-en","repo":"dadazhangn/dsh-prompt-snippets","commit":"0f9ee1307058696d6541fc057cdd40b4fc895bf8","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Prompt Snippets adds a prompt library to the DSH Web composer. Save templates with placeholders, search by name or tag, and organize favorites and history. It supports JSON transfer and optional AI rewrite previews. Snippets stay local unless you request a rewrite through DSH’s configured model.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1947","client.js:3515","index.js:910-962"]}
