{"unit_id":"dadazhangn__dsh-prompt-snippets#feature-1","repo":"dadazhangn/dsh-prompt-snippets","commit":"0f9ee1307058696d6541fc057cdd40b4fc895bf8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Prompt Snippets 的功能「模板变量填写」：保存带占位符的提示词，插入时填写必填值、默认值或选项，并可用日期时间宏。。通过片段面板或 /snippet 命令使用。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:2573-2584"]}
{"unit_id":"dadazhangn__dsh-prompt-snippets#feature-2","repo":"dadazhangn/dsh-prompt-snippets","commit":"0f9ee1307058696d6541fc057cdd40b4fc895bf8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Prompt Snippets 的功能「搜索整理」：从片段面板或快捷搜索查找提示词，并按分类、标签、收藏和最近使用进行整理。。通过片段面板或 /snippet 命令使用。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1947","client.js:3515","index.js:1947"]}
{"unit_id":"dadazhangn__dsh-prompt-snippets#feature-3","repo":"dadazhangn/dsh-prompt-snippets","commit":"0f9ee1307058696d6541fc057cdd40b4fc895bf8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Prompt Snippets 的功能「历史与恢复」：查看并插入旧版本；删除片段可撤销，数据写入采用临时文件和原子替换。。通过片段面板或 /snippet 命令使用。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1947","index.js:642-699","client.js:2934-2946"]}
{"unit_id":"dadazhangn__dsh-prompt-snippets#feature-4","repo":"dadazhangn/dsh-prompt-snippets","commit":"0f9ee1307058696d6541fc057cdd40b4fc895bf8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Prompt Snippets 的功能「AI 改写预览」：使用 DSH 默认模型流式生成改写稿，检查原有占位符并由用户决定插入或替换。。通过片段面板或 /snippet 命令使用。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1947","index.js:910-962","client.js:2690-2700"]}
{"unit_id":"dadazhangn__dsh-prompt-snippets#feature-5","repo":"dadazhangn/dsh-prompt-snippets","commit":"0f9ee1307058696d6541fc057cdd40b4fc895bf8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Prompt Snippets 的功能「JSON 导入导出」：将提示词片段导出为 JSON，或从文件导入并选择合并、替换或预演。。通过片段面板或 /snippet 命令使用。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1947","index.js:1378-1415","index.js:1473-1530"]}
{"unit_id":"dadazhangn__dsh-prompt-snippets#caveat-1","repo":"dadazhangn/dsh-prompt-snippets","commit":"0f9ee1307058696d6541fc057cdd40b4fc895bf8","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"Prompt Snippets 只有在用户主动启动 AI 改写时，才会把所选片段发送给 DSH 配置的模型服务；使用该功能需要默认模型可用。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:852-866","index.js:910-925"]}
